d to aging, including the promotion of elderly care, addressing issues of frailty, and improving the nutritional needs of the elderly population. Through its initiatives, the Sociedad Española de Geriatría y Gerontología aims to advance the understanding and management of health care for elderly patients in Spain.", "DR. MANUEL ANTÓN JIMÉNEZ:Dr. Manuel Antón Jiménez is a geriatrician at Hospital Ntra. Sra. de la Montaña in Cáceres. He plays a significant role in the dietary guidelines for older adults, ensuring that their nutritional needs are met. Additionally, he is actively involved in the study and treatment of elderly patients, focusing on their overall health and well-being. Through his work, Dr. Jiménez contributes to improving the quality of care for the aging population.", "DR. IÑAKI ARTAZA ARTABE:Dr. Iñaki Artaza Artabe is a dedicated geriatrician based at Centro Sociosanitario Igurco Orue in Amorebieta, Vizcaya, where he specializes in the care of elderly patients. He has made significant contributions to the guidelines on nutritional assessment specifically tailored for this demographic. In his professional endeavors, Dr. Artaza Artabe collaborates with Dra. Pilar Matía Martín, focusing on enhancing nutritional assessment practices for the elderly.", "DR. JOSÉ ANTONIO LÓPEZ TRIGO:Dr. José Antonio López Trigo is a prominent geriatrician and the president of the Sociedad Española de Geriatría y Gerontología. He is recognized for his significant contributions to the field of geriatrics, particularly in the area of elderly nutrition. Under his leadership, the society has published valuable insights that enhance the understanding and care of the elderly population.", "DRA. ENCARNA MARTÍN PÉREZ:Dra. Encarna Martín Pérez is a geriatrician at Hospital San Juan de Dios in León, focusing on elderly patient care.", "DR. NICOLÁS MARTÍNEZ VELILLA:Dr. Nicolás Martínez Velilla is a geriatrician at Hospital de Navarra in Pamplona, specializing in the care of elderly patients. He is recognized as an expert in the field of geriatric medicine, particularly for his contributions to the understanding of frailty in the elderly and its implications for healthcare. His work focuses on improving the health outcomes and quality of life for older adults, addressing the complexities associated with aging and frailty.", "DRA. PILAR MATÍA MARTÍN:Dra. Pilar Matía Martín is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology at Hospital Clínico Universitario San Carlos in Madrid. She is actively involved in the nutritional assessment and care of fragile elderly patients, focusing on the development and study of nutritional strategies tailored for this vulnerable population. Her work emphasizes the importance of proper nutrition in enhancing the health and well-being of elderly individuals.", "DR. ROBERTO PETIDIER TORREGROSSA:Dr. Roberto Petidier Torregrossa is a geriatrician at Hospital Universitario de Getafe in Madrid, specializing in elderly care.", "CENTRO SOCIOSANITARIO IGURCO ORUE:Centro Sociosanitario Igurco Orue is a healthcare facility located in Amorebieta, Vizcaya, where Dr. Iñaki Artaza Artabe works.", "HOSPITAL SAN JUAN DE DIOS:Hospital San Juan de Dios is a healthcare facility located in León, where Dra. Encarna Martín Pérez provides geriatric care.", "HOSPITAL DE NAVARRA:Hospital de Navarra is a healthcare facility located in Pamplona, where Dr. Nicolás Martínez Velilla practices geriatrics.", "HOSPITAL CLÍNICO UNIVERSITARIO SAN CARLOS:Hospital Clínico Universitario San Carlos is a prominent healthcare facility located in Madrid, Spain. It serves as a medical institution specializing in clinical nutrition and endocrinology, among other fields. The hospital is notable for its commitment to providing comprehensive medical services and education. Within this institution, Dra. Pilar Matía Martín works as an endocrinologist, contributing to the hospital's focus on specialized healthcare.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO DE GETAFE:Hospital Universitario de Getafe is a healthcare facility located in Madrid, Spain. It is a medical institution where Dr. Roberto Petidier Torregrossa practices geriatrics. Dr. Petidier Torregrosa, who is a geriatrician, is associated with this hospital, contributing to its focus on elderly care.", "HOSPITAL NTRA. SRA. DE LA MONTAÑA:Hospital Ntra. Sra. de la Montaña is a medical institution located in Cáceres. Within this facility, Dr. Manuel Antón Jiménez serves as a practicing geriatrician, providing specialized care for elderly patients."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}